  "firstRunWelcomeTitle": "Welcome to Druid",
  "firstRunWelcomeIntro": "You are a herbalist: you find real plants, photograph them, study them and brew fantasy potions with their Essences. Before you start, the rules of the game in the real world.",
  "firstRunRuleNoPickTitle": "Photograph, don't pick",
  "firstRunRuleNoPickText": "Plants are never picked: you photograph them and they stay where they are. Don't tear off leaves or flowers and don't trample them.",
  "firstRunRuleProtectedTitle": "Protected species and areas",
  "firstRunRuleProtectedText": "Some species are protected by law. In parks and reserves stay on the paths and respect their rules.",
  "firstRunRulePrivateTitle": "No private property",
  "firstRunRulePrivateText": "Don't enter private gardens, fields or land without permission: photograph from where you are allowed to be.",
  "firstRunRuleDaylightTitle": "In daylight",
  "firstRunRuleDaylightText": "Don't go out to play at night or in poor light. Moon Traits last all day: you never need to.",
  "firstRunRuleSafetyTitle": "Watch your step",
  "firstRunRuleSafetyText": "Mind the ground and the traffic: don't take photos while crossing the road or driving. If you go far, tell someone where you are going.",
  "firstRunRuleToxicTitle": "Plants are not food",
  "firstRunRuleToxicText": "Many plants are toxic. Don't eat them and don't use them as remedies: the game's potions are fantasy and give no real instructions for use.",
  "firstRunRuleIdentifyTitle": "Identification can be wrong",
  "firstRunRuleIdentifyText": "Pl@ntNet recognises plants from photos, but it can be wrong. Toxicity warnings are to be checked.",
  "firstRunRulePrivacyTitle": "Your photos and your location",
  "firstRunRulePrivacyText": "Photos go to Pl@ntNet only to recognise the plant. The location of your Stations stays on your phone: it is never shown or shared.",
  "firstRunTermsFooter": "By tapping I agree you confirm you have read these rules and will play carefully and respectfully.",
  "firstRunAccept": "I agree",
  "firstRunCameraTitle": "Photos of plants",
  "firstRunCameraText": "To Meet a plant you photograph it with the app's camera: the whole plant, a leaf and the flower if there is one. Pl@ntNet recognises it and your photo goes into the Herbarium.",
  "firstRunCameraAllow": "Allow",
  "firstRunCameraDenied": "Without the camera you can't Meet plants. You can grant the permission at any time in Android settings, under App permissions.",
  "firstRunLocationTitle": "Location",
  "firstRunLocationText": "Where you photograph a plant a Station is born: you can come back there to Draw. The app needs your precise location, only while you use it. Your Stations stay on your phone: they are never shown or shared.",
  "firstRunLocationAllow": "Turn on",
  "firstRunLocationDenied": "Without location Encounters count, but no Stations are born. You can turn it on at any time in Android settings, under App permissions.",
